{"id":"idhZINDHvW","name":"Ethereum","domain":"ethereum.org","claimed":false,"description":"Ethereum is a technology that's home to digital money, global payments, and applications.","longDescription":"Ethereum.org is a public, open-source website and educational resource that serves as a hub for the Ethereum community. Led by a dedicated core team and funded by the Ethereum Foundation, the platform welcomes contributions from thousands of community members worldwide. The mission of ethereum.org is to become the go-to portal for the growing Ethereum community, providing an easy-to-understand educational resource that covers all aspects of Ethereum. Their goals include explaining Ethereum to newcomers, helping users get started with ETH and Ethereum, assisting developers in building on the platform, and showcasing community-created resources. To achieve this, their team focuses on improving user experience, engaging the community, and incorporating feedback. Ethereum.org embraces the global nature of its community and is constantly evolving to keep up with the ever-changing Ethereum landscape. They prioritize collaboration with the community and experimentation in their approach.","links":[{"name":"twitter","url":"https://twitter.com/ethereum"},{"name":"linkedin","url":"https://linkedin.com/company/ethereum"},{"name":"facebook","url":"https://facebook.com/Ethereum.Foundation"}],"logos":[{"theme":"dark","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idhZINDHvW/w/200/h/200/theme/dark/icon.jpeg?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":null,"format":"jpeg","height":200,"width":200,"size":6541}],"tags":[],"type":"icon"},{"theme":"dark","formats":[{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idhZINDHvW/theme/dark/logo.svg?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transparent","format":"svg","height":181,"width":114,"size":2735},{"src":"https://cdn.brandfetch.io/idhZINDHvW/w/800/h/1268/theme/dark/logo.png?c=1bxixsvzzu3wge90jphd3o3qf2w8oWMg6tL","background":"transpa